WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.380
[Announcer] Conan O'Brien has
the best fans in the world.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.690
Wanna get a selfie or something?

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.072
Yeah, alright.

00:00:05.072 --> 00:00:06.120
(audience laughing)

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.150
[Announcer] That's why he's asked them

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.510
to make an episode of
his TV show, "Conan."

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.270
He calls it "DIY Conan."

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.550
Choose a clip to remake
and submit your video.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:14.560
Andy, come on!

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.750
[Announcer] Conan's
only rule? Be creative.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.290
Top creators will receive a set

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.760
of exclusive new Conan Funko Pop figures

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.550
and one grand prize winner will receive

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.580
a home electronics
package and $5,000 cash.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.413
You.

00:00:26.413 --> 00:00:28.810
[Announcer] Head to teamcoco.com/diyconan

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:29.843
to find out more.

